    <section class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Desktop video workflow</div>
      <h1>Edit, organize and publish short-form video.</h1>
      <p>
        Faler Video Editor is a Windows desktop application designed to help creators prepare
        short-form videos, manage batches and connect supported publishing platforms through
        their own authorized accounts.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
