      <article class="card">
        <div class="num">01</div>
        <h2>Local editing workflow</h2>
        <p>Video preparation and rendering are performed on the user's computer unless the user chooses to publish content to a connected service.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="num">02</div>
        <h2>User-authorized publishing</h2>
        <p>Connections to third-party services use their authorization flows. Users choose which account to connect and can disconnect it.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="num">03</div>
        <h2>Transparent policies</h2>
        <p>These public pages explain how the application handles licensing, account connections, local files and third-party integrations.</p>
